<title>USA: Nevada Housing Division repriced, yields cut.</title>
<headline>Nevada Housing Division repriced, yields cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns &amp; Co., Inc. said on Tuesday it repriced Nevada Housing Division's $25 million bond deal, lowering the yields in several maturities, while leaving the top yield unchanged.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:  </p>
<p>NEVADA HOUSING DIVISION</p>
<p>RE: $25,000,000*</p>
<p>SINGLE FAMILY MORTGAGE BONDS,</p>
<p>1997 SERIES B</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>PLEASE NOTE CHANGE IN SERIAL PRICING 2003 THROUGH 2008.</p>
